(# Loading Dock Procedures) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Overview) Tj
T* (The loading dock operates from 06:00 to 22:00 on weekdays. All trailers must check in with the) Tj
T* (dock coordinator before backing into an assigned bay.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Dock Assignment) Tj
T* (The dock coordinator assigns each trailer to a numbered bay based on the delivery schedule.) Tj
T* (Drivers must not select their own bay without coordinator approval.) Tj
ET
endstream
