/F1 12 Tf
14 TL
72 740 Td
(## Trailer Securing) Tj
T* (Wheel chocks and a dock lock must be engaged before the dock plate is lowered. The dock light) Tj
T* (must show red until securing is confirmed, then green once loading may begin.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Housekeeping) Tj
T* (Pallets, stretch wrap, and strapping debris must be cleared from the dock apron between) Tj
T* (trailers to keep the walkway clear for forklift traffic.) Tj
ET
endstream
